+## Legacy memory-limit API
+
+`RemixResource.SetMemoryLimits(maxCacheSize, maxVRAM)` is a deprecated compatibility no-op.
+Remix has no cache-size or VRAM-limit options matching this API. The two arguments must still be
+numbers and the function still returns `true`, so existing add-ons can call it, but neither value
+sets a limit. The first explicit call logs this once per loaded module lifetime. Module startup
+does not call it. It never writes Remix configuration, including the User layer that Save persists
+to `user.conf`; use the loader's performance tiers for package defaults instead.
+
 ## Installation
 - Switch to the `x86-64` branch of Garry's Mod on Steam
 - Ensure you've ran the vanilla game at least once, especially if you switched branches.
